{"title":"Career roadmap — Junior Energy Auditor","role":"Junior Energy Auditor","summary":"A Junior Energy Auditor supports energy audits by collecting utility and equipment data, conducting site observations, measuring energy performance, identifying inefficiencies, and helping prepare recommendations for reducing electricity, fuel, thermal and renewable-energy consumption.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Renewable Energy Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Renewable Energy","Energy Efficiency","Electrical/Mechanical Systems","Data Analytics","Building/Industrial Energy Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Sc. graduate can enter supporting energy-audit roles, but formal statutory energy-auditor credentials and independent sign-off responsibilities may require additional qualifications, experience, and jurisdiction-specific certification."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary focus","Likely opportunities"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Energy fundamentals, auditing, instrumentation, data analysis"},{"text":"Junior Energy Auditor, Energy Analyst, Energy Efficiency Executive"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Detailed audits, building/industrial systems, modelling"},{"text":"Energy Auditor, Energy Consultant, Energy Manager"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Energy optimisation, decarbonisation, project leadership"},{"text":"Senior Energy Consultant, Energy Efficiency Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Net-zero strategy, digital energy management, leadership"},{"text":"Energy Performance Director, Decarbonisation Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Energy fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Heat transfer basics"},{"text":"Electricity fundamentals"},{"text":"Energy conversion"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics basics"},{"text":"Environmental science"},{"text":"Renewable-energy fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electricity"},{"text":"Natural gas"},{"text":"Diesel"},{"text":"LPG"},{"text":"Steam"},{"text":"Compressed air"},{"text":"Thermal energy"},{"text":"Solar energy"},{"text":"Wind energy"},{"text":"Biomass"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic units:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"kW"},{"text":"kWh"},{"text":"MW"},{"text":"MJ"},{"text":"GJ"},{"text":"kcal"},{"text":"BTU"},{"text":"COP"},{"text":"Energy intensity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Energy systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV"},{"text":"Solar thermal"},{"text":"Wind energy"},{"text":"Biomass"},{"text":"Batteries"},{"text":"Grid systems"},{"text":"Motors"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Fans"},{"text":"Compressors"},{"text":"HVAC"},{"text":"Boilers"},{"text":"Furnaces"},{"text":"Chillers"},{"text":"Lighting systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand efficiency concepts:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Energy input","useful output","losses","efficiency"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power factor"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Load factor"},{"text":"Peak demand"},{"text":"Heat loss"},{"text":"Thermal efficiency"},{"text":"Equipment efficiency"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Energy calculators"},{"text":"Basic electrical measurement tools"},{"text":"Data logging concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Energy auditing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the audit process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pre-audit","data collection","site survey","measurements","analysis","recommendations","savings estimation","reporting"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Utility-bill analysis"},{"text":"Energy benchmarking"},{"text":"Load profiling"},{"text":"Equipment inventory"},{"text":"Energy balance"},{"text":"Measurement and verification"},{"text":"Energy-saving calculations"},{"text":"Payback analysis"},{"text":"Life-cycle cost analysis"},{"text":"Carbon-emission estimation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn audit instrumentation concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clamp meters"},{"text":"Power-quality analysers"},{"text":"Lux meters"},{"text":"Thermal cameras"},{"text":"Temperature sensors"},{"text":"Flow meters"},{"text":"Pressure gauges"},{"text":"Anemometers"},{"text":"Data loggers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Honours/research route"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong project could focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial energy efficiency"},{"text":"Building energy performance"},{"text":"Solar PV performance"},{"text":"HVAC optimisation"},{"text":"Energy-efficient motors"},{"text":"Smart energy monitoring"},{"text":"Battery energy management"},{"text":"Renewable-energy integration"},{"text":"Campus energy audit"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core skill stack"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Energy conversion, efficiency, benchmarking"}],[{"text":"Electrical"},{"text":"Motors, loads, power factor, demand"}],[{"text":"Thermal"},{"text":"Boilers, HVAC, heat transfer"}],[{"text":"Renewable"},{"text":"Solar PV, wind, biomass, storage"}],[{"text":"Auditing"},{"text":"Site surveys, measurements, energy balances"}],[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Payback, ROI, life-cycle costing"}],[{"text":"Carbon"},{"text":"GHG estimation, energy-related emissions"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, statistics, Power BI"}],[{"text":"Measurement"},{"text":"Meters, sensors, thermal imaging"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Audit reports, recommendations, M&V"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"tabl